			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Align header spacing in architecture documentation\n\nAdjust whitespace in `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to match the project's typography standards for headers. Remove inconsistent double spaces following the section emoji and ensure single space separation between the title text and the emoji character.\n\nThis update brings the visual hierarchy of the Architecture document in line with recent standardization efforts in `README.md` and other Grove documentation files, ensuring consistent rendering across all markdown headers.",
